to prepare you for the Last of Us part 2  let's take a look back and recap the  story at the Last of Us and its DLC left  behind The Last of Us begins in  September 2013 with father and daughter  Joel and Sarah it's the night of the  outbreak in the whole world as being  overrun by a fungal infection that turns  people erratic and violent along with  Joel's brother Tommy they attempt to  make their way out of town  unfortunately Sarah doesn't make it in a  shot by one of the US soldiers trying to  contain the outbreak fast forward 20  years and Joel is a smuggler living in a  Boston quarantine zone he and tests a  fellow smuggler and Joel's partner meet  up with Robert who owes them some guns  Robert admits he sold their guns to the  fireflies a militia group rebelling  against the overbearing military  presence and quarantine cities and tests  deals with it in her own unique way Joel  and Tess  try to get their guns back from the  fireflies leader Marlene who will only  return them if they smuggle Ellie a 14  year old girl out of the city Ellie was  bitten by an infected three weeks prior  and hasn't churned typically people  churn in one to two days so Marlene  believes Ellie is the key to finding a  vaccine Joel and Tess are tasked with  bringing Ellie to the Capitol building  and meeting with a group of fireflies  there but when they arrive all the  fireflies are dead it's revealed that  Tess was been and she urges Joel to take  Ellie to his brother Tommy Tommy now  lives in Wyoming and as a former member  of the fireflies should know where to  take Ellie when a group of soldiers show  up tests attempts to hold them off  giving Joel and Ellie time to escape but  at the cost of her life Joel and Ellie  head to a nearby town to meet with an  old friend bill bill owes Joel some  favors and Joel hopes to cash them in to  get a card that'll help take him in  Ellie to Tommy there's a military  caravan that got overrun by clickers and  Bill thinks they can take that battery  and put it in another car unfortunately  for them the battery was already taken  but they later learned it was taken by  bill's older partner Frank and the  battery is now sitting in a truck  luckily they're able to get the truck  running and start their journey out west  Joel and Ellie get attacked by a group  of human hunters in Pittsburgh which  totals their car and forces them to  continue on foot here they met Henry and  Sam two brothers who are  also trying to make it out of Pittsburgh  on the way out they are attacked by a  mounted gun truck and are separated with  Henry and Sam leaving them behind Joel  and Ellie become cornered and jump into  the ocean and when Joel wakes up he's on  the beach with not just Ellie but Sam  and Henry after a heated confrontation  the four of them head towards a radio  tower where survivors from Henry and  Sam's group are supposed to meet them  unfortunately along the way Sam gets  bitten unable to face what's about to  happen  Henry shoots Sam and then kills himself  a few months later in the fall Joel and  Ellie make it to Wyoming where they meet  up with Tommy and his wife Maria they  live in the compound of a dam which  they're trying to repair to get  electricity back Tommy initially refuses  to take Ellie to the fireflies for Joel  but eventually realizes he has to do  this Ellie however isn't so keen on the  arrangement and runs away after a heated  argument  Joel decides that he should take Ellie  instead the two have built trust with  each other and Joel's fatherly instincts  begin to bubble to the surface  Tommy informs them that the fireflies  are stationed at the University of  Eastern Colorado  once there they find that the fireflies  have moved to st. Mary's Hospital in  Salt Lake City Utah on the way out  they're attacked and Joel becomes  severely wounded Ellie is able to lead  them to safety but Joel falls  unconscious now in the winter  Elia is searching for food and runs into  two men David and James David agrees to  give Ellie medicine for the meat on her  dear David reveals that it was his men  who Joel and Ellie attack to the  University but initially he chooses not  to kill Ellie Ellie makes it back to  Joel and injects him with the medicine  but David's men Shrek elite down after  taking out a lot of them David catches  her and throws her in a Cell here we  learned that David's group are cannibals  but he wants to keep Ellie alive for  some more unsavoury desires he has she  refuses to comply so the two men tried  to cut her up but she convinces them  that she's infected and uses this to  make her escape David finds her an  abandoned restaurant and locks the door  eventually she takes his machete and  kills him with it Joel now recovered  catches up with her after she murders  David now in the spring Joel and Ellie  are in Utah once inside the hospital  Marlene and forms them that they can  reverse-engineer a vaccine from Ellie  but they have to kill her  to do it Joel after bonding  le as much as he has doesn't allow this  to happen and kills tons of fireflies  including Marlene he grabs Ellie who's  unconscious from being prepped for  surgery and takes her to Tommy's when  Ellie wakes up Joel lies to her and  tells her that there are tons of immune  people like her and due to them not  working the fireflies aren't even  looking for a vaccine anymore  later when Ellie confronts Joel on if  he's telling the truth he affirms his  position and thus ends the first last of  us the additional story DLC left behind  takes place during two different periods  in time the first is right after the  events of the University of eastern  Colorado Ellie finds herself in an  abandoned Colorado mall looking for  medical supplies there's a military  helicopter lodged in the ceiling with  supplies on board that she manages to  get to after fighting her way through  infected and David's men she gets back  to Joel the other part is three weeks  before the events of the game with Ellie  and Riley Riley Ellie's best friend who  she hasn't seen for weeks decides to  surprise visit informs LA that she  joined the fireflies the two sneak out  to an abandoned mall and have some fun  but Riley tells Ellie that she's  actually being assigned to another city  and did all this because she wanted a  chance to properly say goodbye to Ellie  the two share a kiss but the happy  moment unfortunately comes to a quick  close when a swarm of infected busting  this is the moment where Ellie and Riley  get infected and the two decide to live  out the remainder of their time together  except as we know from the main story  Ellie makes it out okay and that  concludes our journey through the Last  of Us there's a four-issue comic book  series that details Ellie and Riley's  relationship before left behind if  you're looking for even more or less of  us content but otherwise you should be  all caught up for part two thanks so  much for watching for more coverage in  The Last of Us  stay tuned to gain spot  [Music]  you
 

